      "question_text": "For $f(x)=(x-2)^2,\\ x\\ge2$ and $g(x)=2+\\sqrt x$, verify both compositions and state their domains.",
      "solution_text": "$f(g(x))=(\\sqrt x)^2=x\\quad(x\\ge0)$\n$g(f(x))=2+\\sqrt{(x-2)^2}=2+|x-2|=x\\quad(x\\ge2)$\n$f(g(x))=x\\ (x\\ge0),\\ g(f(x))=x\\ (x\\ge2)$"
    }
  },
